{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o174a","title":"荆豫诸军赴援永安吴军退","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o174a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"荆豫诸军赴援永安吴军退","evidence":["shaodi-e-o174a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":{"text":"永安","evidence":["shaodi-q-o174"]},"time":{"year":264,"label":"七月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y264","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o171","basis":"七月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o174a-q","shaodi-q-o171","shaodi-q-o165","shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o174a-q","source_order":[4,841,"O174a"],"order":1293}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o174a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5a153b0277d68035b610","layer":"original","quote":"初，自平蜀之后，吴寇屯逼永安〖1〗；遣荆、豫诸军，掎角赴救〖2〗。七月，贼皆遁退。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o174","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5a153b0277d68035b610","layer":"original","quote":"初，自平蜀之后，吴寇屯逼永安〖1〗；遣荆、豫诸军，掎角赴救〖2〗。七月，贼皆遁退。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
